    native_build_class_surface_misses_newly_added_field_2026-08-17, 1, "2026-11-09 diagnostics landed (stays open): E1012 'class X has no field Y' carries (only under SIMPLE_DEBUG_FIELD_ACCESS/SIMPLE_BOOTSTRAP_DIAG, same gate as the conversion hook; default output unchanged) a note 'class registry: stale-construction|collision|registry def also lacks the field' with instance/registry/shared field counts (interpreter/expr/calls.rs), so the next native-build failure discriminates the two theories in one flagged run (PR #7968)."

